==Strategy==
Bore can be hard to stall, so you will need to focus on the defense; a horde of [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cats]] will help, just like any variant of [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]], [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fried Shrimp Cats]], other overall good defensive cats, including [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rares]]. The best way to do this level is to delay the entrance of the boss as much as possible and save money, then send out the "meatshields" all at once, followed by [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut]], who should be able to finish Bore off. [[Cat Combo]]s may help a lot, especially defensive and offensive ones.

